sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title: Login flow
    actor U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant DB as Database
    U->>B: open page
    B->>+S: GET /login
    S-->>-B: 200 OK
    U->>B: submit credentials
    B->>+S: POST /login
    loop retry up to 3x
        S->>DB: SELECT user
        DB-->>S: row
    end
    alt valid password
        S-->>B: set cookie
    else invalid
        S--xB: 401
    end
    Note right of S: audit log written
    Note over B,S: TLS everywhere
    S->>S: self check
    S-)DB: async event
    B<<->>S: websocket
    deactivate S
